  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the given two signs + and – :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 8 ÷ 4 × 6 + 5 – 9 = 16\n\n**8 ÷ 4**__ × 6 - 5 + 9 = 16\n\n__**2 × 6**__ - 5 + 9 = 16\n\n__**12 + 9**__ - 5 = 16\n\n__**21 - 5**__ = 16\n\n16 = 16 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 15 + 3 × 4 – 6 ÷ 2 = 6\n\n​15 - 3 × 4 + **6 ÷ 2**__ = 6\n\n15 - __**3 × 4**__ + 3 = 6\n\n__**15 + 3**__ - 12 = 6\n\n__**18 - 12**__ = 6\n\n6 = 6 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• **Option - (3) : 3 × 2 – 72 ÷ 6 + 8 = 18**\n\n3 × 2 + **72 ÷ 6**__ - 8 = 18\n\n__**3 × 2**__ + 12 - 8 = 18\n\n__**6 + 12**__ - 8 = 18\n\n__**18 - 8**__ = 18\n\n**10** ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 3 + 4 – 2 × 5 ÷ 1 = 9\n\n​3 - 4 + 2 × **5 ÷ 1**__ = 9\n\n3 - 4 + __**2 × 5**__ = 9\n\n__**3 + 10**__ - 4 = 9\n\n__**13 - 4**__ = 9\n\n9 = 9 (LHS = RHS)\n\nTherefore, Option 3 is not satisfied the equation.\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.\n\n52",
